Third-party components

This project builds on the following open-source software. Each is distributed
under its own license (all permissive: MIT and/or Apache-2.0); their copyrights
remain with their respective authors.

Compiler front-end / tooling (TypeScript side):
  - oxc / oxc-parser  — the TypeScript/JavaScript parser front-end  (MIT)
  - Biome             — lint + format tooling                       (MIT OR Apache-2.0)

Runtime crates the emitted Rust may depend on (Rust side, via `tslib`):
  - serde, serde_json — serialization / JSON fidelity               (MIT OR Apache-2.0)
  - tokio             — async runtime (fs / io)                     (MIT)
  - reqwest           — HTTP client (rustls TLS)                    (MIT OR Apache-2.0)
  - regex             — RegExp fidelity engine                      (MIT OR Apache-2.0)
  - chrono            — Date/time fidelity                          (MIT OR Apache-2.0)
  - indexmap          — insertion-order maps (dev/test)             (MIT OR Apache-2.0)

Full license texts for these dependencies are reproduced in their respective
source distributions (via `cargo`/`bun`). This NOTICE is informational and does
not modify the terms of the licenses above.
